    <item>
      <title>Version 0.0.8</title>
      <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:32:02 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.0.8</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Tasks: any checklist line in a note is a task. Give it a date and it shows up in Today, Upcoming and Inbox</li>
          <li>Quick Add (⌃⌥T) adds a task from any app</li>
          <li>New icons throughout, from Hugeicons</li>
          <li>The sidebar has larger icons, a grey selection and a Today icon showing today's date</li>
          <li>Search the icon picker for any of 6,000 icons, or a brand logo like Google, GitHub or Cloudflare</li>
          <li>Fixed the scratchpad failing to save when its folder was missing</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
