    <item>
      <title>Version 0.0.7</title>
      <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 04:40:23 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.0.7</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>A new Home page: your recent notes, pinned notes, the scratchpad and folders, in your theme's colors. Choose in Settings whether Lotion opens on Home or your last note</li>
          <li>Toggle lists and toggle headings, as in Notion: type &gt; and a space, or pick them from the / menu. They nest, and are saved as standard collapsible sections. A quote is now " and a space</li>
          <li>A smoother caret that fades gently instead of stepping, and stays solid while you type</li>
          <li>Up and Down keep their column through short lines, and the caret no longer hides under the toolbar</li>
          <li>Keyboard shortcuts: ⌘↩ checks a to-do, opens a toggle or follows a link; ⌘/ opens the block menu; Space checks selected to-dos</li>
          <li>VoiceOver now hears what each block is: headings, to-dos, toggles, code and table cells</li>
          <li>More breathing room around scratchpad entries</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
