    <item>
      <title>Version 0.0.6</title>
      <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:12:54 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.0.6</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Quick Note: press ⌃⌥N from any app to jot something down in a small floating window. Each note is an entry in your scratchpad.</li>
          <li>Browse and search older entries, start a new one, copy or delete an entry, or move it into a note of its own.</li>
          <li>A round / button in the corner opens the command menu. Change the shortcut in Settings → Quick Note.</li>
          <li>Lotion now keeps running when you close its window, so the shortcut always works. Quit with ⌘Q, or have it open at login.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
